        "notes": "# **Round 3 \u2013 Power Spike: Orb Overload**\n\n* Pick: [Phantasm](item_21ed9c3d-7a54-438f-9188-f21fd7a7dbfb) + [Alternative Energy](item_c3e816b3-9c39-4528-9578-e3fa610b6cc6).\n\n* Why: These two create an **endless Biotic Power loop:**\n\n    * Biotic Grasp (heal) generates orbs.\n\n    * Fade drops a healing orb.\n\n    * Your standard Biotic Orb.\n\n* **Result:** You\u2019re generating orbs from **three sources** \u2014 and never run out of energy. Fade is off cooldown before your Biotic energy is depleted.\n\n* **Tip:** Keep orbs bouncing around you as a **shield of healing.**",
